_ohc=ykCmkPame0IQ7kNvwHucC5F&_nc_oc=Adk5HADtWVkk6_SJhZZW2KMkAkRCv5AoyGcIAn5kaxBBrW-tjWXimOYq4Vf7-fIeaM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz7YxJbvNpJ4w0YNW_i_WFJHa9BYqdmkCn_cMv3HFcwPQ&oe=69B01E16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art 16_9-6.png", "id": "1326995322515668", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1326995329182334_8355890638329200326_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rB4M8ec1NiYQ7kNvwH9CcKU&_nc_oc=Adn9MEXISvl8_9KDEpOvd3WWBc1AwCXABa7LAX13y5FUbd0oDGI9KpmNAr9q9gQu2_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwLV1a21uUir7OMRC8Y3PK3ZPHnsF2lkrx3R-r9zMzn-w&oe=69B012BD"}, "display_name": "SkyLeap", "keywords": ["parkour", "climbing", "action", "platformer", "shooter"], "long_description": "SkyLeap is a non-stop VR parkour action game where your only goal is to climb higher and higher. Use jumps, a grappling hook, and telekinesis to flow through a vertical world built for speed and movement.\n\n{1813006879397225}\n\nRun, climb, and fight:\n\n\u26a1 Dodge turrets and tricky obstacles\n\n\ud83d\udd2b Use your weapons mid-air\n\n\ud83c\udf00 Chain jumps and telekinesis into fluid combos\n\n\u2b06\ufe0f Keep climbing and push your limits\n\n{792032636563437}\n\nOnly speed, reflexes, and the flow of movement will keep you in the race.\n\n{1516906566071378}\n\nUpgrades, customization, and an energetic soundtrack await.\n\n{836591216091404}\n\nAre you ready to make your leap into the sky?\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "SkyLeap is a non-stop VR parkour action game where your only goal is to climb higher and higher. Use jumps, a grappling hook, and telekinesis to move through a dynamic vertical world designed to keep your momentum flowing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xocus.co/privacy-policy-eng", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XOCUS", "support_website_url": null